"o wa tẹlẹ nipa titẹ bọtini \"Ṣẹda Awọn Profaili Onkọwe PublishPress fun "
"gbogbo awọn olumulo ni ipa\" ninu taabu Itọju."

#: src/modules/multiple-authors/multiple-authors.php:2095
msgid ""
"If the Author is mapped to a WordPress user, this will display the authors' "
"\"Display name\" and their \"Username\". The default is to show only the "
